 "description": {
  "id": "Mode lintas: satu nilai --light-x menggerakkan pita cahaya diagonal, bayangan global, serta sorot dan bayang tiap elemen host sekaligus, lalu cahaya menetap. Mode kilap: kartu mendarat lalu menangkap satu kilap diagonal.",
  "en": "Pass mode: one --light-x value drives a diagonal light band, global shading and per-element highlights and shadows on host elements in lockstep, then the light settles. Gloss mode: a card lands and catches one diagonal specular gloss."
 },
